    {
      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25753.png",
      "text": "ሓደ እዋን ኣብ ከውሒ ዝነብራ ብዙሓት መሓዙት ጊሐታት ነበራ፡፡ ካብኣተን ሓንቲ ጊሐ ንኹለን ትበልፀን ከም ዝዀነት ትነግረን ነበረት፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:ce7f7f864b3248a1ecdfd790e2458bef3c121ce591ea7fa0f26cfc725758373f"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25754.png",
      "text": "ንኹለን መሓዙታ ድማ ትፀርፈንን ትወቕሰንን ነይራ፡፡ ንሳተን ድማ ብተግባራ ኣዝየን ይሓርቃ ነይረን፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:93f7c91cdb5cc6ae4499176c4039eb5df17b1ae01ae6c582f9c25660947dcec0"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25755.png",
      "text": "ከምዚ ኢለን እናነበራ እንከለዋ ፤ ሓደ መዓልቲ በዚ መፀ ዘይተብሃለ ሓደ ወደል ስልሕልሖት ናብቲ ከባቢ መፀ፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:d555a71b84696c91e06b00c2aee84632668484b83ab2ddfc5656f04cbc021b2f"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25756.png",
      "text": "እታ ትምክሕተኛ ጊሐ ድማ ኣብ ዘለቶ ጠጠው ኢላ ጠመተቶ እሞ ፣\" እንታይ እዩ ክገብር? እስኪ ይምፃእ ፥ክሳዱ ሓኒቐ ክድርብዮ እየ\" በለተን፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:9e5413a4beae9588572329a1e959739f2696297183e10e23171530d5a1b203d5"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25757.png",
      "text": "እተን ካልኦት ጊሐታት ድማ ፣\"ንዒ ምስ ዘይዓቕምና ኣይንበኣስ ኣየዋፀአናን\" እንተበልኣ ንሳ ድማ ፣ \"ኪዳ ኪዳ ፈራሓት\" በለተን፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:dbb2b984cfe0263ff2bedffabca4a42e317ee37ca2cd0df8e3438de7aec05303"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25758.png",
      "text": "እቲ ስልሕልሖት ድማ ነጢሩ መፀ፡፡ ነታ ምክሕቲ ጊሐ ብኽሳዳ ሓነቓ ፡፡ ወያ ምክሕቲ ጊሐ \"እ. እ. እ ኣንትን መሓዙተይ በጃኽን እባ ኣገላግሉኒ?\" በለት፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:8cbab5687a65fc872b3ac269ab887110cfdf55352964d8c84702f6f76fc53df0"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25759.png",
      "text": "ንሳተን ድማ ፣\"ንባዕልና ክንብላዕ እንዲና ከመይ ገይርና ክነገላግለኪ\" በላኣ፡፡ ኣብ ኣፍደገ ጉድጓደን ኰይነን ድማ እንታይ ከም እትገብር ይዕዘባኣ ነበራ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:98b05573d596237aa916e9bd80322a372a1851cd437d877a2fecd55eabcc1506"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25760.png",
      "text": "እታ ምክሕቲ ጊሐ ፣ ከምዚ በለት ፤ \"እንታይ እየ ዝገብሮ እንታይ እዩ ወሪዱኒ ጨካን ስልሕልሖት ሎሚ ረኺቡኒ በጃኽን መሓዙተይ ኣገላግላኒ?\" ኢላ ለመነተን፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:54eaf1e7c0d76a42d1b5e5336e215d6600800122a892564227e6709639f3523c"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25761.png",
      "text": "መሓዙታ ድማ ከምዚ በለኣ ፤ \"ወዮ እቲ ሓይልኺ ወዮ እቲ ጃህራኺ ናበይ ድኣኸይዱ ሐዚ ዝበኸኺ ዘይሰድድ ሓያል ሎሚ ረኺቡኪ ንሕናስ ሰኪሕና ብሕማቕ ተግባርኪ ፋሕጠርጠር ድኣ በሊ ኣምልጢ ብዓልኺ\" በለኣ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=9",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:f2053dba70a0539190aaf5d2be110e2f21b41aabdc57f141f84fa304d986bde0"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25762.png",
      "text": "እቲ ስልሕልሖት ነታ ምክሕቲ ጊሐ ቁርጥምጥም ኣቢሉ በልዓ፡፡ ነተን ዝተረፋ ጊሐታት ድማ ክበልዐን ከደ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=10",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:6eb9bc9f945ec0029f23c1c62a8a7412efca46f1d4707104c8d8e634196193ff"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25763.png",
      "text": "እተን ጊሐታት ድማ ናብኣተን ዝመፅእ ምህላው ፈሊጠን ፤ ኣጀኹን ፤ ኣይትፍርሐ ኩልና ብሓደ ኾይና ነኺስና ነኺስና ክንቀትሎ ኢና\" በላ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=11",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:79dad55bb2df7f4dcc9d797b38ea18b0325cf7385ad2671dbf865bb18f24b13a"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/25764.png",
      "text": "ወዮ ስልሕልሖት ድማ ናብኣተን ምስ ቀረበ ፤ እታ ሓንቲ ብኣፉ ፣ እታ ሓንቲ ብኸብዱ፣ እታ ሓንቲ ብጭርኡ ብምሓዝ ነኺሰን ነኺሰን ቀተልኦ፡፡ ብሰላም ድማ ምንባር ጀመራ ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=22019#page=12",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:b4aa1d7336b7c38262786981c4a985ed64155b7e2e32862105dc345d233855b2"
    }
  ],
